    <!-- User Guide -->
    <string name="how_it_works_title">Quick guide</string>
    <string name="how_it_works_desc">1. Open Google Maps and start navigation as usual.\n2. Navi Noti filters and forwards the next step to your watch.\n3. The watch only alerts at key milestones (~100m, ~30m, step changes, and arrival); other distance updates are silent.\n4. Notifications clear automatically when you pause or finish.</string>

